\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> checks.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by traders using the <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Armour_Trader_Table#Traders\" title=\"Magic Armour Trader Table\">levelled magic armour table</a> if the player is between levels 6 and 8</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Models</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 118.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 116.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Splint_Armour_%2B1_Human_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Body Type 1 Front Human\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Splint_Armour_%2B1_Human_Front_Model.webp/175px-Splint_Armour_%2B1_Human_Front_Model.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Splint_Armour_%2B1_Human_Front_Model.webp/262px-Splint_Armour_%2B1_Human_Front_Model.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/cc/Splint_Armour_%2B1_Human_Front_Model.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Splint Armour +1 Human Front\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Splint_Armour_%2B1_Human_Front_Model.webp/175px-Splint_Armour_%2B1_Human_Front_Model.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"117\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Splint_Armour_%2B1_Human_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Body Type 1 Front <br><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t